# Get started

To get started with Giolt, first install the Giolt SDK:

```
$ gleam add --dev giolt_sdk
```

The Giolt SDK includes the CLI to build, develop and deploy your app with Giolt.
To build your app, run:

```
$ gleam run -m giolt build
```

This will create a `./dist` folder with the entrypoint to your app.

## Configuration

The Giolt SDK is configured from `gleam.toml`:

```toml
# gleam.toml
[tools.giolt]
outdir = "./dist",
static_dir = "./public",
entry_module = "app",
bundle_aliases = [
    "@gleam=./build/dev/javascript"
],
```

[Read more about Giolt SDK configuration](/configuration)

